WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:16.660
It was Saturday morning.

2
00:00:16.661 --> 00:00:20.719
"Let's go to the library," said Mom.

3
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:28.032
"Yay!" cheered the kids.

4
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:32.715
The library was busy.

5
00:00:32.716 --> 00:00:38.531
Emmy used the computer.

6
00:00:38.532 --> 00:00:48.742
She looked up books about soccer.

7
00:00:48.743 --> 00:00:53.193
Harry asked the librarian for help.

8
00:00:53.194 --> 00:01:06.199
The librarian helped him find a robot book.

9
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:12.163
Mom found a cookbook.

10
00:01:12.164 --> 00:01:15.348
Then she picked out a movie.

11
00:01:15.349 --> 00:01:19.630
"We can watch this later," she thought.

12
00:01:19.631 --> 00:01:23.371
But Oliver could not find anything.

13
00:01:23.372 --> 00:01:27.884
"I don't know what to get," he grumbled.

14
00:01:27.885 --> 00:01:33.923
"Here's a book about cars," said Mom.

15
00:01:33.924 --> 00:01:40.088
"Cars are boring," said Oliver.

16
00:01:40.089 --> 00:01:42.984
"Here's a snake book," said Emmy.

17
00:01:42.985 --> 00:01:49.702
"I don't like snakes," said Oliver.

18
00:01:49.703 --> 00:01:52.963
"How about this book?" asked Harry.

19
00:01:52.964 --> 00:01:55.753
"It's about bugs."

20
00:01:55.754 --> 00:01:58.039
Oliver smiled.

21
00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:03.062
"I'll get this bug book," said Oliver.

22
00:02:03.063 --> 00:02:10.076
Oliver read the bug book again and again.

23
00:02:10.077 --> 00:02:14.083
He brought it everywhere he went.

24
00:02:14.084 --> 00:02:17.110
It was one week later.

25
00:02:17.111 --> 00:02:19.835
The family was at the library again.

26
00:02:19.836 --> 00:02:23.811
Harry and Emmy returned their books.

27
00:02:23.812 --> 00:02:28.474
Then they looked for new books.

28
00:02:28.475 --> 00:02:32.561
Emmy got one about wizards.

29
00:02:32.562 --> 00:02:39.047
Harry got a tornado story.

30
00:02:39.048 --> 00:02:51.146
But Oliver didn't see any good books.

31
00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:56.739
Finally he had an idea.

32
00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:00.965
"What book are you getting?" asked Mom.

33
00:03:00.966 --> 00:03:09.814
"I'm getting my bug book again!" said Oliver.
